flowchart TB
    A[Capability Request] --> B[Measure Cost Path]
    B --> C{Within Budget?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Continue Normal Path]
    C -- No --> E{Risk Level?}
    E -- Low --> F[Tier Down / Cache / Compress]
    E -- Medium --> G[Defer / Slow Lane / Escalate]
    E -- High --> H[Stop / Pause Automation]
    F --> I[Record Evidence]
    G --> I
    H --> I
    D --> I
